{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/a1573bef35f8d0d91c81b2bb67db7f9b.poster.avif?t=1774106398\" width=1170 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/a1573bef35f8d0d91c81b2bb67db7f9b.webm?t=1774106398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/a1573bef35f8d0d91c81b2bb67db7f9b.mp4?t=1774106398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>AFTER TODAY, YOU\u2019RE NEVER GOING TO FORGET THIS EASTER\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BREAKING NEWS:</strong> <i>A man in a rabbit costume has broken into a local middle school and is attacking students, teachers, and staff with a chainsaw. Authorities have surrounded the building and are attempting to enter without risking further casualties.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as one of the kids trapped inside during the lockdown. The front doors are barricaded, so your only options are escape or death. Stay quiet and move carefully, watch every corner as a direct encounter with the killer could mean certain death\u2026 or worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/1629d01e5c867bc1062281280b067c14.poster.avif?t=1774106398\" width=1170 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/1629d01e5c867bc1062281280b067c14.webm?t=1774106398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/1629d01e5c867bc1062281280b067c14.mp4?t=1774106398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAN YOU SURVIVE LONG ENOUGH TO ESCAPE?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, intense, and terrifying experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear and tension are guaranteed from start to finish. There\u2019s never a moment of rest, it\u2019s a race against time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completely defenseless</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, hide, or die, those are your only options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019ll never know what to expect</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Killer Rabbit is cunning, he\u2019ll always find a way to catch you by surprise when you least expect it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Easter won\u2019t end in a day</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability that keeps you coming back for more, featuring random events in every match, Game Modes, and Challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share the Scares</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into Multiplayer with your friends and try escaping together.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/f386be46f303c0c26476d44e80f8e9ab.poster.avif?t=1774106398\" width=1170 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/f386be46f303c0c26476d44e80f8e9ab.webm?t=1774106398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119160/extras/f386be46f303c0c26476d44e80f8e9ab.mp4?t=1774106398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119160?t=1774106398","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/41